  ('ae5a2d11-0bea-5778-9344-933639a63d7a', 'vnt-01', 'noir-sovereign-aviator', 'Noir Sovereign Aviator', 'Noir Sovereign', 'Sunglasses', 'Unisex', 3450, 4200, 'BDT', '৳', 'An architectural reimagining of the iconic flight silhouette. Features a dark metal-look frame in matte obsidian with dark charcoal sun lenses designed for confident presence and comfortable daylight viewing.', 'Architectural aviator silhouette with matte obsidian styling.', 'Aviator', 'Dark Metal-Look Alloy', 'Matte Obsidian Black', 'Deep Charcoal Tint', 'Polarized-Style Tint', 'Architectural', 'Universal', ARRAY['Classic dual-bar aviator brow profile', 'Matte obsidian dark finish', 'Charcoal-tinted sun lens appearance', 'Adjustable-style cushioned nose pads']::text[], 'Bestseller', true, true, false, true, true, 0, 'Noir Sovereign Aviator Sunglasses | VANTAIRE EYEWEAR', 'Explore the Noir Sovereign Aviator sunglasses by VANTAIRE. Matte obsidian styling with nationwide delivery across Bangladesh.'),
  ('cbd75e22-a7de-534c-9f65-b893888320e6', 'vnt-02', 'monaco-sculpted-square', 'Monaco Sculpted Square', 'Monaco Square', 'Sunglasses', 'Unisex', 3250, 3900, 'BDT', '৳', 'Bold geometric authority meets European resort sophistication. Features a structured tortoise-pattern frame with beveled outer contours and warm amber gradient-look lenses.', 'Chunky beveled tortoise-pattern frame with warm amber gradient lenses.', 'Square', 'Tortoise Acetate-Look', 'Rich Tortoise Havana', 'Warm Amber Gradient', 'Gradient Tint', 'Contemporary', 'Medium', ARRAY['Beveled square rim geometry', 'Rich tortoise pattern finish', 'Warm amber gradient lens appearance', 'Comfort-curved temple arms']::text[], 'Signature Edit', true, true, false, true, true, 1, 'Monaco Sculpted Square Sunglasses | VANTAIRE EYEWEAR', 'Tortoise-pattern square sunglasses with amber gradient lenses. Order via WhatsApp.'),
  ('9cdc9cf4-69fb-5a7e-a0b7-a510923e8a8c', 'vnt-03', 'vesper-pantoscopic-round', 'Vesper Pantoscopic Round', 'Vesper Round', 'Sunglasses', 'Unisex', 2950, NULL, 'BDT', '৳', 'An intellectual, minimalist circular silhouette. Slim wire-look rim in brushed antique gold tone with forest green-tinted lenses for refined vintage-inspired character.', 'Minimalist circular wire profile with forest green-tinted lenses.', 'Round', 'Gold-Tone Metal-Look', 'Brushed Antique Gold', 'Forest Green Tint', 'Polarized-Style Tint', 'Retro', 'Narrow', ARRAY['Slim round wire perimeter design', 'Antique gold metallic appearance', 'Forest green sun-tinted lenses', 'Smooth temple tip sleeves']::text[], 'New Arrival', true, false, true, true, true, 2, 'Vesper Round Sunglasses | VANTAIRE EYEWEAR', 'Antique gold wireframe round sunglasses with green-tinted lenses by VANTAIRE.'),
  ('98da2a97-20cb-5a48-966b-293e85a88031', 'vnt-04', 'verona-architectural-cat-eye', 'Verona Architectural Cat-Eye', 'Verona Cat-Eye', 'Sunglasses', 'Women', 3350, 3800, 'BDT', '৳', 'A sharp, high-attitude uplift sculpted with dramatic brow lines. Tailored for elevated presence from everyday city wear to weekend occasions.', 'Sculpted cat-eye in high-gloss jet black with smoke gradient lenses.', 'Cat-Eye', 'Jet Black Acetate-Look', 'High Gloss Jet Black', 'Smoke Obsidian Gradient', 'Gradient Tint', 'Contemporary', 'Medium', ARRAY['Dramatic upturned browline contour', 'High-gloss jet black frame surface', 'Smokey gradient lens transition', 'Flattering feminine silhouette']::text[], 'Bestseller', true, false, false, true, true, 3, 'Verona Cat-Eye Sunglasses | VANTAIRE EYEWEAR', 'Sculpted jet-black cat-eye sunglasses with gradient lenses. Order via WhatsApp with nationwide shipping.'),
